# Architecture

This repo is a .NET 10 API + Angular 21 client.

## Backend (Clean Architecture)

Target layers:

- `Domain` — entities, value objects, domain rules. No framework deps.
- `Application` — use cases, DTOs, interfaces, validators. Depends only on Domain.
- `Infrastructure` — EF Core, external services, auth persistence. Implements Application interfaces.
- `Api` — HTTP only: endpoints/controllers, middleware, DI composition root.

Rules:

- Dependencies point inward only.
- No business logic in controllers/endpoints.
- Never return EF entities from API; map to DTOs.
- Do not introduce MediatR, Generic Repository, or CQRS unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer vertical slices inside Application by feature/use case when helpful.

## Frontend (Feature-Based)

```text
src/app/
  core/      # singleton services, interceptors, guards, providers
  shared/    # truly reusable UI/utils only
  layout/    # shell/layout
  features/  # one folder per feature
```

Rules:

- Organize by feature, not by file type.
- Features own their pages, components, services, models, and routes.
- No cross-feature deep imports; expose a public API if sharing is required.
- Keep `shared` thin.

## Default stack choices

- .NET 10, nullable enabled, async + `CancellationToken`
- Angular standalone components + Signals
- Tailwind already in client; follow existing styling setup
